at": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "I\u2019m a mess and a perfectionist, yeah,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "A true phenomenon, a puzzle, what do I do with that?"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "But it\u2019s my personality, what makes me unique,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "So I embrace it and cultivate this quirky streak."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}